# Theme Lexicon System (Sanitized)

The theme lexicon specification remains available at a conceptual level for public review.

## Overview
- Maps high-level theme identifiers to rendering configuration buckets.
- Provides translation helpers that keep UI and rendering styles consistent.
- Allows runtime swapping of approved visual themes.

## Sanitized Notes
- Enumerations, keyword tables, and debug shortcuts have been removed from this publication.
- Implementation wiring to animation, physics, or reaction systems is documented only in the internal archive.
- Refer to the private style guide for exhaustive theme definitions and authoring workflows.
